                <pb facs="0338" n="268" xml:id="pg268"/>

                <head>No. 131.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Davis to Mr. Morton</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1883-05-25"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 25,
                        1883</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Express to family of Laboulaye sincere condolence and sympathy with them in their
                    bereavement.</p>
                <closer><signed>DAVIS,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Acting
                    Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
